self.KB_CONTENT["card:754045"]={"id":"card:754045","ty":"card","sourceId":"754045","title":"『分析資料網頁產生作業』中的『HTML 所在 UNC 目錄 (ADM.MS002)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"分析","keywords":["分析","銷售","安裝"],"y":"other","answer":"* 不可空白。* 若銷售分析 HTML 資料所在 UNC 目錄為空白時，則預設安裝目錄 (UNC型式目錄) + '\\S_HTML\\'。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
