self.KB_CONTENT["card:758104"]={"id":"card:758104","ty":"card","sourceId":"758104","title":"『採購單嘜頭憑證』中的『選擇FAX/Email傳送方式』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"採購單","keywords":["採購單","憑證","廠商","傳送"],"y":"other","answer":"* 計1.FAX To 廠商、2.Email To 廠商、3.FAX To 自訂對象、4.Email To 自訂對象。* 當傳送方式為「FAX To 廠商」或「FAX To 自訂對象」，則預覽列印列上的FAX/Email鈕下之EMAIL選項不可輸入。* 尚未購買『FAX/Email處理系統』(FEP)，FAX/Email需隱藏。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
